OL,5,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe first visit of the week is to
OL,7,     FAbbey Court Guest House in
OL,8,     FCarlisle. Host Kelly aims to
OL,9,     Fimpress with plush rooms and
OL,10,     Fabseiling. But will breakfast
OL,11,     Fcomplaints send her chances off a
OL,12,     Fcliff?
OL,13,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,14,     FGlam couple Rob and Heloisa host
OL,15,     Fat The Lime Tree Inn in Yorkshire,
OL,16,     Fwhere chef Rob pulls out all the
OL,17,     Fstops at breakfast. It's a shame
OL,18,     Fthe cleaners didn't do the same in
OL,19,     FKelly's bathroom.
